      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e1",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "We included randomized controlled trials (RCT) and cluster RCTs designed to evaluate the efficacy of opioids prescribed for relief of acute pain in ED-­discharged patients compared to nonopioid analgesics. All types of pain complaints were considered. We excluded studies exclusively on patients with substance use disorder or chronic pain, evaluating only opioids given during the ED stay, comparing different opioids head-­to-­head, not reporting pain intensities or pain relief (after contacting authors), or available only as abstracts.",
      "reason": "Eligibility specifies study designs (RCT/cluster RCT), population/setting (ED-discharged patients), intervention/comparator (opioids vs nonopioid analgesics), and an outcome requirement (pain intensities or pain relief reported after author contact). However, required follow-up/timepoint requirements are not explicitly stated."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "There were no exclusions based on language or date of publication.",
      "reason": "Language and date restrictions are explicitly addressed (no exclusions). Publication/report status is partially specified by exclusion of studies “available only as abstracts,” but dissemination year range and broader publication/report status criteria are not fully detailed."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The evidence does not distinguish exclusions due to outcomes not being measured versus exclusions due to outcome results not being reported."
    },
    {
